{
  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in one deterministic specification with clear exploration states and dedicated obstacle-recovery states. The policy prioritizes move_forward in clear conditions, inserts only occasional brief random_walk for coverage variation, uses directed one-shot turns for side obstacles, and reserves a single brief move_backward only for front-obstacle recovery. Uncontrollable events are total in every specification state, with path_clear usually self-looping in action states and obstacle events forcing safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate environment perception from motion capability in G so E can enforce the task policy cleanly.",
    "Use one main policy automaton in E with exactly one controllable action in each action state and total uncontrollable branching in every state."
